[{"title":"题丁子坚所藏张彦道画唐官进马图（时二公皆御史归田）","author":"邓雅","text":"张君上疏归来早，画笔犹为当世宝。\n向来得意写龙媒，云雾晦冥雷电扫。\n青丝络辔御者谁，却忆唐官初进时。\n万里来从沙漠道，九衢翻动雪霜蹄。\n当时天子惜良马，亦命韩生作图画。\n只今閒却两青骢，春草春风在原野。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31431,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题杨妃出浴图","author":"邓雅","text":"春光淡淡春风起，百啭黄鹂宫树里。\n宫中妃子绣罗衣，晴来出浴温泉水。\n温泉之水清且涟，凝脂洗尽争春妍。\n初疑沧海浴明月，又如玉井开红莲。\n君王一见生欢喜，六宫粉黛谁能比。\n一曲霓裳乐未终，边尘已暗三千里。\n天生尤物徒尔为，马嵬竟死谁能悲。\n丹青一幅半零落，千载君王当鉴之。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31432,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄周主事文瞻二首 其一","author":"邓雅","text":"天上辞荣日，山中养道年。\n閒将玉箸篆，写出白云篇。\n夜月蒲萄酒，秋风䆉稏田。\n知君有真乐，那得共盘旋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31433,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄周主事文瞻二首 其二","author":"邓雅","text":"寂寞山房里，思君未识君。\n空瞻一片月，还隔几重云。\n伐木莺求友，巢松鹤不群。\n物情与人事，感叹不堪闻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31434,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送知县曹哲德明美解赴京","author":"邓雅","text":"家住燕山北，官居紫淦浔。\n三年惟饮水，永日祗弹琴。\n政体吾皇意，天知令尹心。\n行看书上考，入觐五云深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31435,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题谢氏兰玉堂","author":"邓雅","text":"琼树三山种，幽兰九畹香。\n移栽宜胜地，列映近高堂。\n自可纫仙佩，真堪比玉郎。\n因之怀谢傅，几叶尚留芳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31436,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谢友人惠首服","author":"邓雅","text":"角巾存古制，何必华阳求。\n一幅劳相赠，千金未足酬。\n花间堪漉酒，松下免科头。\n迥觉添萧散，逢迎远俗流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31437,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谢子晟惠藤杖","author":"邓雅","text":"岭表归来日，枯藤得几枝。\n情深烦遣赠，老去赖扶持。\n正直能同操，匀员颇中规。\n终当乘暇日，拄到谢家池。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31438,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"忆上海令黄子律","author":"邓雅","text":"独坐看新月，长吟忆故人。\n婵娟同此夜，离别又经春。\n白发催人老，青山入梦频。\n无由一相见，顾影倍伤神。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31439,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"客馆辞归","author":"邓雅","text":"铁冠兼卉服，老去乐清贫。\n流水琴中趣，閒云物外身。\n竹房留客惯，花径弄孙频。\n自有幽栖处，喧嚣颇厌人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31440,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题李氏盘谷","author":"邓雅","text":"幽居似盘谷，流水绕柴门。\n意适观鱼鸟，年深长子孙。\n耕耘聊自给，理乱未曾闻。\n何日操藜杖，从君远世纷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31441,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题张行之竹间亭","author":"邓雅","text":"偶逢溪上友，因造竹间亭。\n路径通幽寂，烟云入杳冥。\n坐来清客思，题处有僧名。\n最喜安巢凤，朝朝刷锦翎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31442,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽黄玉润","author":"邓雅","text":"未见还堪恨，云亡恨更多。\n麟经藏箧笥，马鬣葬山坡。\n无复蒲轮召，空闻薤露歌。\n高风不可仰，吾道竟如何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31443,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题西门巡检瞻云堂（太行人）","author":"邓雅","text":"天际秋云起，官居思不任。\n宁同弘景趣，还有狄公心。\n渺渺千重白，微微万里阴。\n因之忆亲舍，远在太行深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31444,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送谢子厚随父之武昌","author":"邓雅","text":"落日千山路，长风万里舟。\n亲朋怜远别，父子乐同游。\n白浪过彭蠡，苍烟望鄂州。\n非耽览奇胜，定省足消忧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31445,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题龙伯原桃源小隐","author":"邓雅","text":"草屋孤村迥，桃花一水深。\n不同潘岳趣，还有武陵心。\n渔父应相问，仙家或可寻。\n年年爱春色，把酒对芳林。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31446,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白石砚","author":"邓雅","text":"一片太古雪，窗间犹未融。\n坚凝端石比，瑩彻水精同。\n颇怪胚腪异，堪誇制作工。\n琢磨经几世，挥洒对清风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31447,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冰壶为宋一俊赋","author":"邓雅","text":"表里俱澄澈，光涵一室中。\n浑疑广寒月，落在水晶宫。\n冷沁神仙骨，形全造化功。\n平生爱萧爽，拟入访壶公。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31448,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题朱学渊石室山房","author":"邓雅","text":"石室炎天冷，云窗白昼昏。\n仙人常对弈，诗客屡过门。\n檐外松千尺，琴边酒一尊。\n陶然忘世虑，不似属乾坤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31449,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮春同友人观江涨","author":"邓雅","text":"江树雨潇潇，江波断板桥。\n望洋心若失，泛艇兴偏饶。\n且共渔竿乐，须逃府檄招。\n白鸥知客意，并戏亦飘飘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31450,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"清明日扫先坟","author":"邓雅","text":"已过寒食节，况值落花天。\n对雨情无限，思亲泪泫然。\n丘墟迷草莽，天地惨风烟。\n有鸟来何处，哀鸣向我前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31451,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"客中春望有怀永平毛教谕弘济西安何大使维翰","author":"邓雅","text":"青山长不改，白发日偏多。\n客思迷芳草，年华逐逝波。\n旧交成契阔，往事亦蹉跎。\n西北关山远，相思奈若何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31452,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"悼亡","author":"邓雅","text":"蚤岁期偕老，中年慨独存。\n凭棺惟洒泪，剪纸莫招魂。\n令德宜家室，深恩及子孙。\n终当求密石，为尔表高坟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31453,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄何幼恭（时余失内助幼恭年将五十生子甫及一周而失之俱可恸也）","author":"邓雅","text":"我有悼亡戚，君怀无后忧。\n暮年那见此，老泪不能收。\n世事恍如梦，江波空自流。\n吟诗聊自遣，寄赠若为酬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31454,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题曾氏松关白云","author":"邓雅","text":"白云何处宿，旦暮绕松关。\n变化能为雨，氤氲长在山。\n湿添枝叶重，晴锁户庭閒。\n未可自怡悦，从今愿往还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31455,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题周宗祥绿阴清昼堂","author":"邓雅","text":"手种堂前树，经年长绿阴。\n午风眠处冷，昼日坐来深。\n喜得山林趣，能知雅颂音。\n何当分半席，萧爽散尘襟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31456,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送徐御史服阕之京","author":"邓雅","text":"海内贤良士，人间孝义儿。\n衰麻初脱后，纶綍再徵时。\n路去金陵远，帆开葛水迟。\n应攀坟上柏，洒泪告行期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31457,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题渊明画像","author":"邓雅","text":"渊明非嗜酒，寓意酒杯中。\n大化观天地，閒情对菊松。\n风流千载上，感慨几人同。\n稽首瞻遗像，云开见华嵩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31458,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题张孟宪绿阴棋墅","author":"邓雅","text":"林园新雨后，棋墅夏凉初。\n嘉木荫窗户，青山成画图。\n机心元不竞，世事本来疏。\n未问橘中叟，斯人仙者徒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31459,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题邹恒吾沧洲渔隐","author":"邓雅","text":"结屋住沧洲，开轩瞰碧流。\n鸟啼烟树晚，风起荻花秋。\n秫酒还堪醉，鲈鱼亦易求。\n陶然忘世虑，天地一虚舟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31460,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽成之刘进士","author":"邓雅","text":"岁月穷经传，名声重甲科。\n暮年遭丧乱，吾道竟蹉跎。\n正喜藏修好，其如老病何。\n贻文嗟绝笔，痛哭望松萝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31461,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽何同德","author":"邓雅","text":"一代衣冠士，平生铁石心。\n有才乖世用，多难祗愁吟。\n岁月容华老，风霜肺病侵。\n不堪埋玉树，痛哭泪沾襟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31462,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晏起","author":"邓雅","text":"老夫常晏起，饭后始梳头。\n懒慢从人笑，清閒得自由。\n美蔬聊当肉，大布可为裘。\n邻叟时相问，农谈酒数瓯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31463,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题钱氏石田书隐","author":"邓雅","text":"石田春水满，林馆白云多。\n旧业惟耕学，閒情托咏歌。\n地偏宜竹树，檐迥带藤萝。\n亦有藏修意，何当共琢磨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31464,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题王炼师云巢","author":"邓雅","text":"石洞还堪隐，松云亦可巢。\n九真劳梦想，五老托神交。\n混沌含元气，氤氲湿翠梢。\n醉眠惟伴鹤，群翼任啾啁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31465,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送伯良姚君之广西金城寨巡检","author":"邓雅","text":"圣主求贤日，将军领命时。\n金城烦警逻，铁马正驱驰。\n日月昭王化，弓刀示武威。\n瘴烟看扫尽，岭表悉平夷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31466,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽丁御史子坚","author":"邓雅","text":"仕为文章显，名因政事香。\n泮芹新雨露，台柏旧风霜。\n往事空流水，荒阡几夕阳。\n遥知千载后，潜德有辉光。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31467,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"何彦徽从军辽东其父往问因寄","author":"邓雅","text":"令子三年戍，严君万里行。\n艰难俱可念，相见若为情。\n辽海悲闻鹤，天河愿洗兵。\n尺书将远意，归马看升平。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31468,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山中见梅有怀吟梅老人何幼恭","author":"邓雅","text":"白发堪怜我，贞姿喜见梅。\n倚阑成独笑，带雪为谁开。\n天地含元气，山林产异材。\n遥知东阁里，吟赏兴悠哉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31469,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题陈氏学堂山房","author":"邓雅","text":"宦族宗秦国，山居扁学堂。\n古今留翰墨，草木有辉光。\n倚剑丹霄近，看书白日长。\n何当借云榻，共话到羲皇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31470,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重题","author":"邓雅","text":"地为人增重，山因学著名。\n旧藏书籍在，新筑草堂成。\n捲幔通云气，鸣琴杂涧声。\n知君事游息，养素薄时荣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31471,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过孤山峡","author":"邓雅","text":"窈窕孤山峡，潺湲一涧泉。\n望中如削玉，听处似鸣弦。\n路转疑逢虎，峰高欲近天。\n恍然得平旷，林木数家烟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31472,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"忆母","author":"邓雅","text":"独夜沧州月，清光照胆寒。\n倚阑情脉脉，忆母泪漫漫。\n感慨成千古，忧思集万端。\n那堪听乌鸟，啼到五更残。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31473,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄邹贡士仲律","author":"邓雅","text":"故人久不见，消息始相闻。\n未说文章进，深知行义敦。\n读书忘岁月，为客信乾坤。\n头白嗟何补，期君共讨论。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31474,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉和李如愚见寄","author":"邓雅","text":"老鹤千年寿，閒云一片心。\n乾坤今古事，风月短长吟。\n宦族西平远，仙家玉笥深。\n何当骑白鹿，閒暇一相寻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31475,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄赠医士刘东樵","author":"邓雅","text":"方书传几世，丹鼎有神功。\n身在壶天里，民跻寿域中。\n杏林藏一虎，宝匣卧双龙。\n欲问长生药，螺山隔几峰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31476,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"客中有怀何大镛朱学渊","author":"邓雅","text":"去岁重阳日，曾同醉菊花。\n别来无雁信，望断惜春华。\n风雨江亭暮，云山客路赊。\n思君才入梦，厌杀乱啼鸦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31477,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"客中寄文彬","author":"邓雅","text":"细雨清明近，幽斋白日长。\n怀君当此际，为客在他乡。\n有恨花随水，无情鬓易霜。\n遥知故园竹，新笋过邻墙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31478,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄临江道纪王默渊","author":"邓雅","text":"圣代兴玄教，真人领篆章。\n道书藏玉笥，官舍倚清江。\n已羡承恩泽，终能肃纪纲。\n惊看斩邪剑，每夜吐光芒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31479,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题艾子才括苍吏隐卷","author":"邓雅","text":"我游群玉洞，君寓括苍山。\n出处虽殊调，心神本共閒。\n煮蒲居石室，收印入松关。\n岂被浮名缚，悠然天地间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31480,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题百华寺","author":"邓雅","text":"兹山白云里，古寺觉城东。\n径湿莓苔雨，窗寒薜荔风。\n传经由慧远，洗砚忆陶公。\n暂借禅床坐，心澄万虑空。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31481,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吉文罗允瞻作时思堂以祀先而又闵其妇翁萧君彝翁死义而无后乃附祭于堂","author":"邓雅","text":"萧君死节义，罗氏重彝伦。\n礼谨春秋祀，恩隆内外亲。\n九京宁有憾，两姓幸相因。\n千载斯堂在，闻风亦怆神。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31482,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄刘进士伯琛 其一","author":"邓雅","text":"旧交多寂寞，高士近何如。\n白首穷经传，青山绕屋庐。\n种松招海鹤，俯槛爱池鱼。\n养素无荣辱，心存太古初。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31483,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄刘进士伯琛 其二","author":"邓雅","text":"伊昔曾相见，论诗一解颜。\n别来经岁月，望断隔云山。\n抚事偏多感，逃名且自閒。\n葛峰多胜迹，那得共跻攀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31484,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"柬丘行素","author":"邓雅","text":"久别丘行素，重逢发半苍。\n世情无系累，文物有辉光。\n岁月宜琴酒，乾坤任海桑。\n相知几人在，万感集中肠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31485,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"风雨访刘孔殷不遇","author":"邓雅","text":"潇潇溪上雨，淅淅树间风。\n拟访天台客，难追葛水踪。\n尺书鸿雁远，樽酒父兄同。\n饮罢题诗去，重来意颇浓。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31486,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宜咏楼","author":"邓雅","text":"危楼供远眺，髣髴在黄州。\n翠合群山晚，凉生万竹秋。\n古今怀胜迹，天地汎虚舟。\n此兴宜高咏，浮名不用求。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31487,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游郁木","author":"邓雅","text":"郁木多朋辈，重游累作期。\n峡寒霜落早，涧曲水行迟。\n药拟分瑶草，书仍访墨池。\n平生耽野趣，一到一题诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31488,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄吴六舅从吾先生","author":"邓雅","text":"儒名推令族，吾舅冠群伦。\n但倚文为富，休论病是贫。\n莓苔深巷雨，花木故园春。\n近想多新作，犹烦远寄频。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31489,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"忆外舅（陈姓字怀远）","author":"邓雅","text":"外舅襄阳远，音书恨未通。\n关河奔走外，乡国乱离中。\n暗草江南路，晴云塞北鸿。\n一尊林下酒，谈笑几时同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31490,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"枕上作","author":"邓雅","text":"梦断五更时，山家鸡乱啼。\n风生梧树里，月过纸窗西。\n为客心牢落，伤时气惨悽。\n遥怜征战地，万骨委尘泥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31491,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠别席焕章","author":"邓雅","text":"风流席子云，游艺最超群。\n卷里新诗句，毫端小篆文。\n折梅曾寄我，看竹又逢君。\n独有怜才意，临岐不忍分。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31492,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次玉笥罗提点竹间韵","author":"邓雅","text":"闻师卧竹阴，故我竹间寻。\n嵇阮平生趣，求羊太古心。\n月明看凤宿，风起听龙吟。\n想得题诗处，毫端翠色侵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31493,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄姚观海","author":"邓雅","text":"白发感秋风，凄凉世事空。\n昔交骑马客，今伴钓鱼翁。\n岁月閒吟里，风尘醉眼中。\n可怜同里闬，只是各西东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31494,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题陈汉仁雪舫","author":"邓雅","text":"幽人住城市，小屋似扁舟。\n素壁光含雪，银床冷浸秋。\n乘风慕璚岛，钓月忆沧洲。\n同郡多名士，相过听棹讴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31495,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"凿井","author":"邓雅","text":"移家修竹里，凿井屋西偏。\n未尽两日力，能通三尺泉。\n味甘同玉液，色湛见青天。\n颇快慈亲饮，容颜胜去年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31496,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠满公太虚","author":"邓雅","text":"杖锡游方外，诗名满世间。\n相同明月好，心似白云閒。\n香雾天龙绕，松风海鹤还。\n知师容入社，堂上有慈颜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31497,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"七夕留屏山馆中","author":"邓雅","text":"去岁山中客，曾为七夕吟。\n感时怀往昔，守拙到如今。\n生计田园薄，羁愁岁月深。\n不知牛女会，还识此时心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31498,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题永丰令蔡行素朴实斋","author":"邓雅","text":"百里安民俗，陶然太古风。\n布衣无长物，茆屋有焦桐。\n未觉羲农远，真堪卓鲁同。\n何须种桃李，桑柘满城东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31499,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]